# Skill: Create NestJS Module (@CreateNestModule)

When invoked with `@CreateNestModule <module-name>`, execute the following steps:
1. Create directory `apps/backend/src/modules/<module-name>/`.
2. Generate `<module-name>.controller.ts` with explicit HTTP REST verbs and DTO validation guards.
3. Generate `<module-name>.service.ts` handling business logic, idempotency checks, and database interactions.
4. Generate `dto/<module-name>.dto.ts` containing Zod schemas and TypeScript type inferences.
5. Create `<module-name>.spec.ts` containing unit test stubs using Jest.
6. Register module in `apps/backend/src/app.module.ts`.
